{"pageid":711,"title":"Uncertainty Cave","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Uncertainty Cave</span>","revid":21718,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Uncertainty Cave</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/34/Uncertaintycaveentrance.png/revision/latest?cb=20241014182639\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Uncertaintycaveentrance\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/34/Uncertaintycaveentrance.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241014182639\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/34/Uncertaintycaveentrance.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241014182639 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/34/Uncertaintycaveentrance.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241014182639 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Uncertaintycaveentrance\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Uncertaintycaveentrance.png\" data-image-name=\"Uncertaintycaveentrance.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"NPC\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">NPC</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mushroo\" title=\"Mushroo\">Mushroo</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Shop, Mushrooms</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.4.1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 11th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"notice\" style=\"border-radius:15px; border:3px solid #505050; background:#444417; font-size:90%; width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p style=\"margin-bottom:.3em\"><span style=\"font-size:125%; font-weight:semi-bold\">This page is <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Outdated\" title=\"Category:Outdated\">outdated</a>!</span><br />\n<span>You can help the Oaklands Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Uncertainty_Cave?action=edit\">updating it</a>.</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Uncertainty Cave</b> is a speciality cave located at the bottom of <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a>'s desertlands' fissure. To navigate to the cave, players must go through the Oke Caves, the caves of the desertlands, into the canyon. It is best to be careful as the <a href=\"/wiki/Boomite\" title=\"Boomite\">Boomite</a> Caves are also connected to the Oke Caves. Another way to access the cave is to drive off into the fissure and flip the vehicle once landed, granted there are no trailers.  \n</p><p>The Uncertainty Cave is characterized by a deep purple fog and lightly-colored lavender sands. The cave is expansive with high ceilings and multiple levels within the same cavern. \n</p><p>Mysterious Mushrooms on the ceiling of the cave shoot poisonous spores at the player, requiring the player to hide and heal as they explore the cave. The spore projectiles confer an anti-gravity effect to the player, allowing them to float and reach the ceiling of the cave. It is recommended that the player have a <a href=\"/wiki/Healing_Coil\" title=\"Healing Coil\">Healing Coil</a> (bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a>) to quickly regenerate health while exploring the cave.   \n</p><p>There are three walls that can be broken with explosives in Uncertainty Cave. One leads to the entrance of Fungi Finds. The other two walls are both secret entrances to Fusion Lake containing <a href=\"/wiki/Oobmab\" title=\"Oobmab\">Oobmab</a>, a purple species of <a href=\"/wiki/Bamboo\" title=\"Bamboo\">Bamboo</a>, along with Tamed Mysterious Mushrooms, a unique flower.   \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span></h2>\n<p>The cave is home to five types of <a href=\"/wiki/Mushrooms\" title=\"Mushrooms\">Mushrooms</a> - Red, Green, Blue, Purple, and <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">Mysterious Mushrooms</a>. The former four mushroom types spawn on the ground, while Mysterious Mushrooms spawn on the ceiling of the cave. The different colors of Mushrooms have equal monetary value regardless of color (except the Mysterious variety). Mysterious Mushrooms offer a much higher profit, both for its wood and cap.   \n</p><p>The last type of wood available in Uncertainty Cave is Oobmab wood, which can be farmed at the hidden lake behind the explodable walls adjacent to Fungi Finds.  \n</p><p>\nUncertainty Cave is also the only spawn location for <a href=\"/wiki/Fungoidite\" title=\"Fungoidite\">Fungoidite</a> nodes, which can have one rare ore type - <a href=\"/wiki/Fungiviolet\" title=\"Fungiviolet\">Fungiviolet</a>. No other ores spawn in Fungoidite nodes, and Fungiviolet ores have a distinct neon glow that can be seen without a Flashlight. </p><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 386px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5f/Uncertaintylocation.png/revision/latest?cb=20230822081258\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Location of Uncertainty Cave, indicated by the red dot\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5f/Uncertaintylocation.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/386?cb=20230822081258\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"386\" height=\"272\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Uncertaintylocation.png\" data-image-key=\"Uncertaintylocation.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Uncertaintylocation.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Location of Uncertainty Cave, indicated by the red dot</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Stores\">Stores</span></h2>\n<p>There are two shops located in Uncertainty Cave:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fungi_Finds\" title=\"Fungi Finds\">Fungi Finds</a> (Shop)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Pirate_Boat\" title=\"Pirate Boat\">Pirate Boat Shop</a></li></ul>\n<p><b>Fungi Finds</b> is a secret shop hidden behind a destructible wall. This shop offers mainly decoration and quality-of-life items, such as <a href=\"/wiki/Dice\" title=\"Dice\">Dice</a>, Music Discs, and three statue decorations; <a href=\"/wiki/Kallostide\" title=\"Kallostide\">Kallostide</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Moai\" title=\"Moai\">Moai</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Teacup\" title=\"Mysterious Teacup\">Mysterious Teacups</a>. \n</p><p>The <b>Pirate Boat</b> shop sells high-tier explosives, which can be used on breakable walls. This shop moves around the map, with the dock at Uncertainty Cave being a potential location for this shop. The explosives this shop offers are convenient for accessing Fungi Finds and the Oobmab spawn location, both of which require explosives to enter. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special_Quests\">Special Quests</span></h2>\n<p>There are three secret quests that require the use of Uncertainty Cave to complete:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Refined/Forged <a href=\"/wiki/Inkstone\" title=\"Inkstone\">Inkstone</a> can be enchanted into <a href=\"/wiki/%3F_%3F_%3F\" title=\"? ? ?\">?&#160;?&#160;?</a> when it comes in contact with a spore projectile, then it will turn into a neon pink block. This special ore is useful in completing the <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertain_Pickaxe\" title=\"Uncertain Pickaxe\">Uncertain Pickaxe</a> quest. The special &#160;?&#160;?&#160;? ore is used to be placed on pedestals at specific points around the map, summoning the one and only <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertain_Pickaxe\" title=\"Uncertain Pickaxe\">Uncertain Pickaxe</a>.</li>\n<li>Fusion Lake or Oobmab Lake is required for the <a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">Fusion Coil</a> quest. Firstly, the player must use explosives - at minimum, a <a href=\"/wiki/Small_Bomb\" title=\"Small Bomb\">Small Bomb</a> - to destroy one of the two breakable walls and open the entrance. By placing a <a href=\"/wiki/Healing_Coil\" title=\"Healing Coil\">Healing Coil</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Speed_Coil\" title=\"Speed Coil\">Speed Coil</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Gravity_Coil\" title=\"Gravity Coil\">Gravity Coil</a>, and an <a href=\"/wiki/Infused_Core\" title=\"Infused Core\">Infused Core</a> into the lake, the materials combine to create a Fusion Coil. The coils can be bought from the Classic Store, and the Infused Core can be created by taking a <a href=\"/wiki/Meteor_core\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Meteor core\">Meteor Core</a> from the site of a meteorite impact and putting it into contact with a spore projectile from a Mysterious Mushroom.</li>\n<li>Tamed Mysterious Mushrooms from the Fusion Lake can be used in a multiple part quest to obtain the elusive Petalbloom, obtained at multiple shrines that need to hold a specific flower from multiple locations.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other\">Other</span></h2>\n<p>In the place where you combine coils to make a <a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">Fusion Coil</a>. Now there is an entrance to <a href=\"/wiki/The_Void\" title=\"The Void\">The Void</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>When selling any type of Mushroom, note that the caps of Mushrooms are considered wood. Mushroom caps should be cut off from the stalk and sold raw for the most profit, as they are destroyed when sanded. <i><b>*I recommend to not sand the caps on accident lol*</b></i></li>\n<li>The cave is likely to be inspired in the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://refinerycaves.fandom.com/wiki/Purple_Cave\"><u>Purple Cave</u></a> from Refinery Caves due to the fact that both are related to mushrooms and both contain a water source.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Locations_Nav\" title=\"Template:Locations Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Locations_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Locations_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption>Oaklands Wiki</figcaption></figure>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0; margin:0\">\n<table class=\"navbox\" style=\"border-radius:5px 5px 0 0; font-size:95%; padding:0; text-align:left; width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" class=\"navbox-group\" style=\"background:#372A27; font-size:100%; border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0; text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations\" title=\"Category:Locations\"><b>Locations</b></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"navbox-group\" style=\"width:10%; background:#372A27; c